langar hai kamar mein abed hai safar mein<br>
ashkoun ki ziya hai ab haq ki sahar mein<br>
<br>
1. ummat ne sataya, kya khoon rulaya<br>
they dard ke paikar, zakhmoun ke nagar main<br>
haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad<br>
<br>
2. abid ka tadapna, phupiyon se ye kehna<br>
durron ki aziyat, hai hum pa safar mein<br>
haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad<br>
<br>
3. hai zainab-e-muztar, be maqna-o-chadar<br>
qaidi bani aayi, baba ke nagar mein<br>
haye zainab haye zainab haye zainab haye zainab<br>
4. nabiyoun ka gharana, ummat ka satana<br>
kaabe ko hai dhana, khaliq ki nazar mein<br>
haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad<br>
<br>
5. woh shaam ka manzar, aur abed-e-muztar<br>
hai paoun me bedi, mehshar hai nazar mein<br>
haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad<br>
<br>
6. sojao sakina (haye), baba hai na seena<br>
mitti ka hai bistar, aur khaak hai sar mein<br>
haye zindaan haye zindaan haye zindaan haye sajjad<br>
<br>
7. wo shaam ki rahein, aur us pa jafaein<br>
hungama-e-mehshar, hai raha guzar mein<br>
haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad<br>
<br>
8. har lamha musibat, durron ki aziyat<br>
hai aal-e-mohammed, ghurbat ke safar mein<br>
haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad<br>
<br>
9. sar nouke sina par, quran hai lab par<br>
tableeq-e-risalat, hai raah guzar mein<br>
haye mazloom haye mazloom haye mazloom<br>
<br>
10.mushkil hai sambhalna, dushwaar hai chalna<br>
zaalim ne pinayee, zanjeer kamar mein<br>
haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad<br>
<br>
11.nazron ko jhukale, muh apna chupale<br>
zainab hai khule sar, zaalim tere ghar mein<br>
haye zainab haye zainab haye zainab haye sajjad<br>
<br>
12.kode na laga’o, naize na chuba’o<br>
bimaar hai abed, maaro na safar mein<br>
haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad<br>
<br>
13.kaanton pe chalaya, abed ko rulaya<br>
ashkon ka talatum, hai deedaye tar mein<br>
haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad haye sajjad<br>
<br>
14.dil hashmi ka hai, aur karbobala hai<br>
awaaz-e-raza hai, matam ke safar mein<br>
langar hai kamar mein abid hai safar mein